<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text" office:version="1.4">
  <office:styles>
    <style:default-style style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm" fo:line-height="100%"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="8pt" style:font-name="Noto Sans CJK TC"/>
    </style:default-style>
    <style:style style:name="Title" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="center" fo:margin-bottom="0.04cm"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="14pt" fo:font-weight="bold"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Heading" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-top="0.08cm" fo:margin-bottom="0.03cm"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="10pt" fo:font-weight="bold"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Small" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="7pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Center" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="center"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:styles>
  <office:automatic-styles>
    <style:page-layout style:name="PageLayout">
      <style:page-layout-properties fo:page-width="21cm" fo:page-height="29.7cm" style:print-orientation="portrait" fo:margin-left="0.45cm" fo:margin-right="0.45cm" fo:margin-top="0.45cm" fo:margin-bottom="0.45cm"/>
    </style:page-layout>
    <style:style style:name="PageBreak" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:break-before="page"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Grid" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #000000" fo:padding="0.03cm" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="GridSmall" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #000000" fo:padding="0.015cm" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="6pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Col" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.05cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="WideCol" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="2.3cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Table" style:family="table">
      <style:table-properties style:width="20cm"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:automatic-styles>
  <office:master-styles>
    <style:master-page style:name="Standard" style:page-layout-name="PageLayout"/>
  </office:master-styles>
  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">桃園市平鎮區公所申請－低收入戶及中低收入戶－中低收入老人生活津貼□身心障礙者生活補助□兒童及少年生活扶助 調查表</text:p>
      <text:p>　年度 ■新申請 微型保險被保險人：＿＿＿＿；受益人＿＿＿＿身分證字號＿＿＿＿，與被保險人關係＿＿＿＿申請人簽章＿＿＿＿</text:p>
      <text:p>□複查 □本案同意維持原被保險人及受益人 □本案需更換被保險人及受益人(需另填切結書) □本案自願放棄加保權益</text:p>
      <text:p>申請日期：＿＿年＿＿月＿＿日；文件備齊日期：＿＿年＿＿月＿＿日；補件日期：第1次＿＿年＿＿月＿＿日；第2次＿＿年＿＿月＿＿日</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Heading">壹、基本資料</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="Basic" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>申請人姓名：＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>連絡電話：＿＿＿＿　行動電話：＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>戶籍地址：＿＿＿＿里＿＿＿＿鄉＿＿＿＿路(街、新村)＿＿段＿＿巷＿＿弄＿＿街＿＿號＿＿樓之＿＿　聯絡地址：＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>居住狀況：□自有住宅 □租賃(每月租金＿＿＿＿元) 機構安置□自費□公費　□醫療院所＿＿＿＿　□其他＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>□借住(□直系親屬 □非直系親屬 □朋友，房屋所有人姓名：＿＿＿＿＿＿，國民身分證統編：＿＿＿＿＿＿，電話：＿＿＿＿＿＿)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>身　份：□一般□平地原住民　□山地原住民　□榮民(領取院外就養金□是，領取＿＿元□否) □其他地區移民 □其他＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>□是　□否　單親家庭（育有18歲以下子女）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>□是　□否　有外籍配偶</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>

      <text:p text:style-name="Heading">貳、全家人口及收入狀況：(請依據國稅局、稅捐稽徵單位提供財稅資料及實際調查資料填寫)</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="Household" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col" table:number-columns-repeated="17"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□號</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>不計入人口</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>身份</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>列冊(申領者)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>稱謂</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>姓名／身分證字號</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>出生年月日</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>足歲齡</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>婚姻</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>職業無原因（請註明）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>健康疾病障別等級</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>收入項目（每月）單位：新台幣元</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>動產（一年）現金、存款本金、有價證券、股票、投資之合計</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>不動產全家人口之土地、房屋合計</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>郵政劃撥局帳號</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>工作收入／利息收入／退休俸、院外就養金／其他收入／租賃所得、營利所得／其他津貼／小計</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>1</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>V</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>本人</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□已婚□未婚□離婚□喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□無</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□輕□中□重□極重</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>房　土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>2</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□已婚□未婚□離婚□喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□無</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□輕□中□重□極重</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>房　土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>3</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□已婚□未婚□離婚□喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□無</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□輕□中□重□極重</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>房　土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>4</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□已婚□未婚□離婚□喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□無</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□輕□中□重□極重</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>房　土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>5</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□已婚□未婚□離婚□喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□無</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□輕□中□重□極重</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>房　土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>6</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□已婚□未婚□離婚□喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□無</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□輕□中□重□極重</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>房　土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>7</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□已婚□未婚□離婚□喪偶</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□無</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>□輕□中□重□極重</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"><text:p>房　土</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="12"><text:p>(人口欄位不足時，請在此浮貼)　小計</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="GridSmall"/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>

      <table:table table:name="Review" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/><table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p text:style-name="Heading">參、核計結果</text:p><text:p>審核項目</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>審核結果</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>全家人口數/有工作能力人數</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>全家　人／能力　人</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>全家每月總收入/平均每人每月收入</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>＿＿＿＿＿＿／＿＿元</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>全家人口存款利息(年)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>＿＿＿＿元</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>動產（現金、有價證券、股票、投資）(年)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>＿＿＿＿元</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>不動產（土地　筆、房屋　筆）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>＿＿＿＿元</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="Heading">肆、調查意見（請敘明）</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="Opinion" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/><table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>請簡述案家成員生活近況，特殊需求及建議事項</text:p><text:p>1.是否實際居住戶籍地？□是　□否 現居＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿</text:p><text:p>3.請簡述家庭人口健康、工作狀況、親友支援及申請低收入戶主要原因。(請勾選) □照顧老人 □兒少滿案 □身心障礙 □支持系統不足 □其他變故</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>2.是否有同一戶籍或共同生活之前配、其他直系親屬□是</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="Heading">伍、區公所審核意見及簽章</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="OfficeReview" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/><table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/><table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>低收入戶</text:p><text:p>1.□不符合資格：</text:p><text:p>□收入□動產□不動產□其他</text:p><text:p>2.□符合第＿＿款低收入戶，自＿＿年＿＿月起至＿＿年＿＿月止。</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>中低收入戶</text:p><text:p>1.□不符合資格：</text:p><text:p>□收入□動產□不動產□其他</text:p><text:p>2.□符合資格，自＿＿年＿＿月起至＿＿年＿＿月止。</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>中低收入老人生活津貼</text:p><text:p>1.□不符合資格：</text:p><text:p>□收入□動產□不動產□其他</text:p><text:p>2.□符合1.5倍，自＿＿月起發放＿＿＿＿</text:p><text:p>□符合2.5倍，自＿＿月起發放＿＿＿＿</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>區公所審核：里幹事＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿　承辦人＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿</text:p>
      <text:p>＿＿課長＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿　機關首長＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿</text:p>
      <text:p>陸、市府核定意見及簽章(低收及中低收入戶不符案、訪視案、申復案，身障生活補助訪視案、申復案須送府複審)</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="FinalReview" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="WideCol"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>核定意見</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid">
            <text:p>1.不符合低收入□中低收入資格□身心障礙者生活補助</text:p>
            <text:p>□收入超過 □動產超過 □不動產超過□無法實訪</text:p>
            <text:p>□其他＿＿＿＿</text:p>
            <text:p>2.符合社會救助　□低收入戶第＿＿款　□中低收入戶</text:p>
            <text:p>□身心障礙者生活補助，毎月核發新臺幣＿＿＿＿元</text:p>
            <text:p>自＿＿年＿＿月起至＿＿年＿＿月止</text:p>
            <text:p>備註：</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Grid"><text:p>承辦人</text:p></table:cell>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="PageBreak"/>
    </office:text>
  </office:body>
</office:document>